#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:143
msgid "Build faster. Ship sooner. Stay in control."
msgstr "让开发更高效，让上线更从容，让一切尽在掌握。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:145
msgid ""
"Pinmok handles the repetitive parts of every project — menus, permissions, "
"themes, content — so you can focus on what actually makes your product "
"different."
msgstr ""
"Pinmok 负责处理每个项目中的重复性工作——菜单、权限、主题、内容——使您能够专注于"
"真正构筑产品差异化的核心业务。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:153
msgid "Go to Admin Panel"
msgstr "进入后台管理"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:164
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:172
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "打造专属于你的应用"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:174
msgid "Head to Template Management and install a theme. Your site, your look."
msgstr "前往模板管理，安装一个主题，即可拥有你自己的网站。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:183
msgid "Set the basics"
msgstr "进行基础配置"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:185
msgid ""
"Configure your site name, logo, and contact info in Site Settings. Takes two "
"minutes."
msgstr "在站点设置中，设置好名称、Logo和联系方式，两分钟搞定。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:194
msgid "Start publishing"
msgstr "开始发布内容"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:196
msgid ""
"Create categories, write articles, build pages. Everything you need is "
"already there."
msgstr "分类、文章、页面，想要的都有，直接用就行。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:218
msgid "Up and running in minutes"
msgstr "几分钟内上手"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:220
msgid ""
"No boilerplate, no guesswork. A conventional project structure means you "
"write your first feature on day one, not after a week of setup."
msgstr "约定优于配置，开箱即用。第一天就能写业务，不用在环境搭建上浪费时间。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:237
msgid "Grows with your project"
msgstr "与项目共同成长"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:239
msgid ""
"Enable only what you need. Every feature is self-contained and replaceable — "
"scale from a simple blog to a full-featured platform without rethinking your "
"architecture."
msgstr "按需启用，功能独立可替换，从简单博客到完整平台，架构从不是瓶颈。"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:260
msgid "Ready for a global audience"
msgstr "面向全球用户"

#: .\pinmok\content\templates\content\welcome.html:262
msgid ""
"Multilingual content and interface support is built in from day one. "
"Reaching new markets doesn't mean rewriting your codebase."
msgstr "原生支持多语言，开拓国际市场无需多写一行代码。"

